data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_part.done","sequence_number":98,"item_id":"rs_0a99d3436ce66413016aca792cc4fc81959be08074d2299397","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"part":{"type":"summary_text","text":"**Building HTTP server tests**\n\nI'm considering creating a small HTTP server with HTML client tests using the built-in fetch. I have ample time to implement this, so I'll decide whether to use server-generated HTML or a static client API for a clean setup. For the database, I’ll use SQLite to store data, with a default path for the database. I'll set up endpoints for managing projects, ensure safety with integer IDs, and handle navigation within the UI. I'll also test persistence and API validation."}}

